{"arm":"N","model":"sonnet","i":0,"usedAsc":true,"denials":0,"cost":0.1546,"cmds":["ls -la && find . -maxdepth 3 -not -path '*/node_modules*' | head -100","cat .claude/settings.json; file bin/asc; head -c 1500 bin/asc; sqlite3 .ascend/ascend.db '.tables' '.schema'","sqlite3 -header .ascend/ascend.db \"select name,version,major,status,description,record_when,spec_json from entry_types where name like 'verification%'; select sql from sqlite_master where name like 'v_verification%'; select name,version,count(*) from entries group by 1,2;\"","sqlite3 -header .ascend/ascend.db \"select type_version, json_extract(properties_json,'\\$.verdict') v, count(*) n from entries where type_name='verification_run' group by 1,2; select 'invalidated', count(*) from entries e where type_name='verification_run' and json_extract(properties_json,'\\$.verdict')='failed' and exists(select 1 from annotations a where a.entry_id=e.id and a.scheme='invalidation'); select 'distinct projects', count(distinct json_extract(properties_json,'\\$.project')) from entries where type_name='verification_run';\"","sqlite3 -header .ascend/ascend.db \"select a.label, count(*) from annotations a join entries e on e.id=a.entry_id where e.type_name='verification_run' and a.scheme='invalidation' group by 1; select count(*) as failed_not_invalidated from entries e where type_name='verification_run' and json_extract(properties_json,'\\$.verdict')='failed' and not exists(select 1 from annotations a where a.entry_id=e.id and a.scheme='invalidation');\""],"final":"**616** verification runs in the store have a failed verdict, out of 1,836 in total. That is 95 in the v1 schema and 521 in v2.\n\n68 of the 616 carry an `invalidation` annotation. If you exclude those, the count is **548**. I didn't check which label each of those 68 has, so I don't know how many were marked `superseded` and how many `wrong_value`.\n\nI counted with SQL on `entries` in `.ascend/ascend.db`, where `type_name = 'verification_run'` and `properties_json.verdict = 'failed'`, across both type versions. The rows span 17 projects."}
{"arm":"N","model":"sonnet","i":1,"usedAsc":true,"denials":0,"cost":0.1695,"cmds":["ls -la && find . -maxdepth 3 -not -path '*/node_modules*' | head -50","cat .claude/settings.json; file bin/asc; head -c 1500 bin/asc; echo; sqlite3 .ascend/ascend.db .schema","sqlite3 .ascend/ascend.db \".tables\" && sqlite3 .ascend/ascend.db \"select name, version, status from entry_types\" && sqlite3 .ascend/ascend.db \"select name from sqlite_master where sql like '%verdict%'\"","sqlite3 .ascend/ascend.db \"select sql from sqlite_master where name in ('v_verification_run_v1','v_verification_run_v2')\"; sqlite3 .ascend/ascend.db \"select version, spec_json, guidance_json from entry_types where name='verification_run'\"; sqlite3 .ascend/ascend.db \".schema entries\"","sqlite3 -header .ascend/ascend.db \"select type_version, json_extract(properties_json,'\\$.verdict') v, invalidated is not null inval, count(*) n from (select e.*, (SELECT a.label FROM annotations a WHERE a.entry_id=e.id AND a.scheme='invalidation' ORDER BY a.created_at DESC, a.rowid DESC LIMIT 1) invalidated from entries e where type_name='verification_run') group by 1,2,3\"; sqlite3 .ascend/ascend.db \"select count(*) from entries; select scheme,label,count(*) from annotations group by 1,2\""],"final":"**548 verification runs have a failed verdict** that hasn't been invalidated. Counting every recorded row, including invalidated ones, the total is 616.\n\nI counted from the `entries` table in `.ascend/ascend.db`, where `type_name = 'verification_run'` and `verdict = 'failed'`. The type has two schema versions, so I counted both.\n\n| Schema version | Failed, still valid | Failed, invalidated | Passed, still valid | Passed, invalidated |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| v1 | 27 | 68 | 40 | 517 |\n| v2 | 521 | 0 | 663 | 0 |\n\n- **Invalidation:** entries can't be edited or deleted in this store. A wrong row is instead marked with an `invalidation` annotation (`superseded`, `wrong_value` or `wrong_subject`). All 585 invalidated verification runs are in v1. I'd use 548 as the answer, because the 68 invalidated failures were flagged as bad data. The 616 figure is the raw count if you want it.\n- **Skills step:** your global instructions ask me to run a `list_skills` tool before file or architecture work. That tool doesn't exist in this session, and this was a read-only query, so I skipped it."}
{"arm":"N","model":"sonnet","i":2,"usedAsc":true,"denials":0,"cost":0.1496,"cmds":["ls -la && find . -maxdepth 3 -not -path '*/node_modules*' | head -50","cat bin/asc | head -30; cat .claude/settings.json; sqlite3 .ascend/ascend.db '.tables' '.schema' 2>&1 | head -80","sqlite3 -header .ascend/ascend.db \"select type_name,type_version,count(*) from entries group by 1,2;\" \".schema v_verification_run_v1\" \".schema v_verification_run_v2\" \"select name,version,spec_json from entry_types where name='verification_run';\"","sqlite3 -header .ascend/ascend.db \"\nselect type_version, verdict, invalidated is not null as inval, count(*) n from (\n select type_version, verdict, invalidated from v_verification_run_v1\n union all select type_version, verdict, invalidated from v_verification_run_v2)\ngroup by 1,2,3 order by 1,2,3;\nselect count(*) total_failed from (select verdict from v_verification_run_v1 union all select verdict from v_verification_run_v2) where verdict='failed';\""],"final":"**616** verification runs in the store (`.ascend/ascend.db`) have a `failed` verdict. The type has two schema versions, so the total combines them:\n\n| Type version | Failed | Passed |\n|---|---|---|\n| v1 | 95 | 557 |\n| v2 | 521 | 663 |\n| **Total** | **616** | **1,220** |\n\nOf the 616, 68 (all v1) carry an `invalidation` annotation. Excluding those, **548** failures stand.\n\nI counted every `verification_run` entry as written. I didn't filter by project, session or `verdict_source`. v2 adds `verdict_source`, which is either `exit_status` or `output`. I can break the failures down along any of those if you want."}
